  <programDescriptions>
      <programName xml:lang="en">Accredited TOGAF® Training – Foundation &amp; Practitioner (10th Edition)</programName>
      <programSummaryText xml:lang="en">Accredited TOGAF® training based on the 10th Edition. Foundation or Practitioner, with exams during the week or exam vouchers afterwards.</programSummaryText>
      <programDescriptionText xml:lang="en">Master enterprise architecture with the accredited TOGAF® Training from The Unit Company, a recognised educator since 2008 and leading provider since 2010. Delivered by experienced, practising trainers, this course prepares you fully for the official TOGAF® exams based on the TOGAF® Standard, 10th Edition.

Choose the option that fits your goals:
- Foundation (2 days): full preparation for the TOGAF EA Foundation exam, with an exam voucher after training.
- Foundation (3 days): includes premium exam preparation and the official exam on the training location within the same week.
- Practitioner (4 days): combines Foundation and Practitioner materials, including Learning Studies, exam vouchers and the TOGAF Applied Practitioner badge.
- Practitioner (5 days): as above, with premium preparation and both exams taken during the week.

You receive digital documentation, practice exams and official badges and certificates from The Open Group upon passing. Available as classroom, in-house and live online training, in English, across the Netherlands, Belgium and Germany.</programDescriptionText>
      <webLink xml:lang="en">https://www.theunitcompany.com</webLink>
  </programDescriptions>

